  "description": "An engine-neutral console foundation with manager-centered logging, retained entries, command history, typed synchronous command workflows, stateless autocomplete, optional history change events, and opt-in command permissions and availability checks. Workes.ContentSystem provides internal storage while the public API remains ConsoleSystem-owned.",
