  "releaseNotes": "Version 0.4.0 continues the ContentSystem-backed rebuild introduced in 0.2.0. It adds opt-in command permissions, reusable permission roles, runtime availability checks, and access-aware autocomplete to the 0.3.0 foundation. ContentSystem remains outside the public API. This is not a drop-in upgrade from the legacy 0.1.0 package.",
